 "system": {
  "description": "<p>Touch; one creature or object. Ends one curse automatically if it came from a spell of 3rd level or lower; otherwise make a casting check (d20 + casting-stat modifier + half your level) vs DC 10 + the curse's source level. A cursed item stays cursed but can then be removed. Cast reversed (Curse): Will negates; -4 to one ability score or Disadvantage on one of attack rolls, saving throws or attribute checks (your choice) for 1 hour per level.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Paladin, Witch</p>",
